@startuml chatwoot-ta-phases
!theme plain
title Chatwoot-TA — Deployment Phases & Gates

skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Phase 0 — Pre-flight + bootstrap +
read-only discovery (writes
terraform/discovery/do-not-touch.json);
note right
  Validates tools, AWS, Cloudflare,
  quotas. Picks non-overlapping VPC CIDR.
end note

if (Operator typed 'proceed'?) then (yes)
  :Phase 1 — VPC + 2 NAT GWs +
  per-AZ subnets + SGs;
  :**GATE**: 2 subnets x3 tiers,
  2 NAT GWs available;
  :Phase 2 — EKS + nodegroup
  (custom LT, secondary EBS) +
  IAM (Manajemen User + IRSA)
  + ECR + S3;
  :**GATE**: cluster ACTIVE,
  >=2 nodes Ready, LVM-ready
  disk visible via SSM;
  :Phase 3 — RDS Multi-AZ +
  Redis HA + Secrets Manager;
  :**GATE**: RDS available + Multi-AZ,
  Redis 2 nodes + auto-failover;
  :load-secrets.sh writes the
  Chatwoot secret payload;
  :Phase 4 — ACM (DNS-validated
  via Cloudflare) + SES domain
  identity + DKIM/SPF/DMARC;
  :**GATE**: ACM ISSUED;
  :Phase 5 — Ansible:
  LVM via SSM, cluster add-ons,
  ESO, Chatwoot Helm,
  Cloudflare app CNAME;
  :**GATE**: /data mounted on all,
  ExternalSecret synced,
  >=2 web + >=2 sidekiq Ready,
  ALB hostname present;
  :Phase 6 — Optional integrations
  status (already wired via ESO);
  :Phase 7 — CloudWatch +
  Fluent Bit + optional Datadog;
  :Phase 8 — scripts/verify.sh
  prints PASS/FAIL acceptance table;
  stop
else (no)
  :Abort — no billable resource created;
  stop
endif

@enduml
